# The marketing site needs no environment variables or secrets today:
# it is a static landing page and has no server functions.
#
# If you add server code (createServerFn / server routes), keep secrets
# server-side only:
#   - Local dev: copy this file to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill values.
#   - Production: `pnpm wrangler secret put NAME`
#   - Never prefix secrets with VITE_ (those are inlined into the client bundle).
#
# EXAMPLE_SECRET=
